    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this, it's a great start on the tone. It definitely feels personal and not spammy.\n\nHowever, I just ran it through the automation tool and it got a score of 0. Marketing is being a bit difficult about it—they won't approve any emails that score below a certain threshold because they want to make sure we're actually demonstrating the value of the CRM. \n\nCould you try a version that weaves in some of those specific features I listed earlier? I still really need it to feel warm and professional, so try not to make it a boring list, but we definitely need to see more of those product names in there to get that score up. Can you try to get the score a bit higher while keeping the empathy?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a revised draft:\n\nSubject: We're Here to Support Your Growth in FlowState CRM\n\nDear [User Name],\n\nWe've missed you in FlowState CRM, and we want to know how we can help you get back on track. Whether you've hit a rough patch or just need some extra support, we're here to help. Our platform is designed to make it easier to manage your pipeline, stay on top of your email sequences, and collaborate with your team in real-time.\n\nAs you revisit FlowState CRM, you might notice how our automated lead scoring feature can help you prioritize your most promising leads. We've also made it easier to visualize your pipelines and stay up-to-date on contact information with our contact sync and pipeline visualization features. Plus, you can take advantage of our email sequence builder and task automation to streamline your workflows.\n\nOur team has been working hard to enhance our platform with features likecustom report generation, real-time analytics, and mobile app access. We're also committed to helping you achieve your business goals with our smart calendar sync and AI forecasting capabilities.\n\nIf you're ready to start using FlowState CRM again, we'd love to help. Feel free to reply to this email or give us a call at [phone",
